You are confusing several levels. The two smaller castles you noticed
are the FAKE wizard levels. There are always two of those, and you
won't find the wizard there, just some monsters.

43, in your game, is Orcus' Lair, the "ghost town".

Levels 44, 45 and 46 are the Wizard of Yendor's Tower (this tower is
square). The entrance to this tower is on level 46 (again, in your
game).

Vlad's Tower must be looked for a lot higher in Gehennom.  An extra
up-stairwell leads to Vlad's Tower, between levels G13 and G18 (G1 is
the Valley of the Dead). Vlad is no longer part of Gehennom, but the
extra stairwell leads to a dungeon branch (like the Mines or the
Quest). This is probably why you didn't notice Vlad.

